<title>AUSTRALIA: Fujitsu picks Canberra for A$10 computer centre.</title>
<headline>Fujitsu picks Canberra for A$10 computer centre.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian unit of Japanese computer giant Fujitsu will set up a A$10 million Asia-Pacific desktop support centre in Canberra, creating 900 jobs, the Australian Government said on Monday.</p>
</text>
